Package: ilovethisclass
Type: Package
Title: Documented Datasets for BZAN 1135
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Robert S.", "Smith",
    email = "68797484+ProfessorSmooth@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a simulated used-car sales dataset and variable
    documentation for teaching introductory statistical analysis in BZAN 1135.
    Each observation represents one fictional vehicle sale. The data support
    exploratory analysis, categorical coding, and linear regression exercises.
